{"content_text": "{\"protocolSection\":{\"identificationModule\":{\"nctId\":\"NCT01412047\",\"orgStudyIdInfo\":{\"id\":\"M07-003\"},\"organization\":{\"fullName\":\"Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"},\"briefTitle\":\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria Human Anti-Human Antibodies Study\",\"officialTitle\":\"A Post Marketing, Multi-Center, Trial to Measure Human Anti-Human Antibodies (HAHA) to Soliris (Eculizumab) in Patients With Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\"},\"statusModule\":{\"statusVerifiedDate\":\"2017-10\",\"overallStatus\":\"COMPLETED\",\"expandedAccessInfo\":{\"hasExpandedAccess\":false},\"startDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2012-03\"},\"primaryCompletionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2013-06\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"completionDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2013-06-30\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"},\"studyFirstSubmitDate\":\"2011-08-05\",\"studyFirstSubmitQcDate\":\"2011-08-05\",\"studyFirstPostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2011-08-08\",\"type\":\"ESTIMATED\"},\"lastUpdateSubmitDate\":\"2017-10-16\",\"lastUpdatePostDateStruct\":{\"date\":\"2017-10-18\",\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"sponsorCollaboratorsModule\":{\"responsibleParty\":{\"type\":\"SPONSOR\"},\"leadSponsor\":{\"name\":\"Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc.\",\"class\":\"INDUSTRY\"}},\"oversightModule\":{\"oversightHasDmc\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDrug\":false,\"isFdaRegulatedDevice\":false},\"descriptionModule\":{\"briefSummary\":\"How does long term treatment with Soliris affect HAHA in PNH patients?\",\"detailedDescription\":\"To determine the long term effect of Soliris (eculizumab) treatment on the presence of human anti-human antibodies (HAHA) in Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria (PNH) patients.\"},\"conditionsModule\":{\"conditions\":[\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\",\"PNH\"],\"keywords\":[\"Paroxysmal Nocturnal Hemoglobinuria\",\"PNH\",\"Human Anti-Human Antibody\",\"HAHA\",\"Soliris\",\"eculizumab\"]},\"designModule\":{\"studyType\":\"OBSERVATIONAL\",\"designInfo\":{\"observationalModel\":\"OTHER\",\"timePerspective\":\"PROSPECTIVE\"},\"enrollmentInfo\":{\"count\":75,\"type\":\"ACTUAL\"}},\"outcomesModule\":{\"primaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"To summarize the proportion of patients with neutralizing HAHA antibodies.\",\"timeFrame\":\"Six (6) months\"}],\"secondaryOutcomes\":[{\"measure\":\"To summarize the proportion of patients with non-neutralizing HAHA antibodies.\",\"timeFrame\":\"Six (6) months\"},{\"measure\":\"To summarize the proportion of patients with increased hemolysis in setting of neutralizing HAHA antibodies.\",\"timeFrame\":\"Six (6) months\"}]},\"eligibilityModule\":{\"eligibilityCriteria\":\"Inclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* PNH patients who previously participated in study E05-001;\\n* Patients who have an eculizumab naive serum sample for comparison;\\n* Patients who currently used commerical Soliris;\\n* Patients who are willing and able to gie written informed consent.\\n\\nExclusion Criteria:\\n\\n* There are no exclusion criteria for this study.\",\"healthyVolunteers\":false,\"sex\":\"ALL\",\"stdAges\":[\"CHILD\",\"ADULT\",\"OLDER_ADULT\"],\"studyPopulation\":\"Patients with PNH previously enrolled in study E05-001, who have a eculizumab naive serum sample available for comparison, and who are currently receiving treatment with commerical Soliris.\",\"samplingMethod\":\"NON_PROBABILITY_SAMPLE\"},\"contactsLocationsModule\":{\"overallOfficials\":[{\"name\":\"Camille Bedrosian, MD\",\"affiliation\":\"Alexion Pharmaceuticals, Inc.\",\"role\":\"STUDY_DIRECTOR\"}],\"locations\":[{\"facility\":\"University Park Hematology Oncology\",\"city\":\"Englewood\",\"state\":\"Colorado\",\"zip\":\"80113\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":39.64777,\"lon\":-104.98776}},{\"facility\":\"Cleveland Clinic Florida\",\"city\":\"Weston\",\"state\":\"Florida\",\"zip\":\"33331\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":26.10037,\"lon\":-80.39977}},{\"facility\":\"Maine Cancer Center of Medicine\",\"city\":\"Scarborough\",\"state\":\"Maine\",\"zip\":\"04074\",\"country\":\"United States\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":43.57814,\"lon\":-70.32172}},{\"city\":\"Melbourne\",\"country\":\"Australia\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":-37.814,\"lon\":144.96332}},{\"city\":\"Brussels\",\"country\":\"Belgium\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":50.85045,\"lon\":4.34878}},{\"city\":\"Paris\",\"country\":\"France\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":48.85341,\"lon\":2.3488}},{\"facility\":\"Universitatsklinikum Essen\",\"city\":\"Essen\",\"country\":\"Germany\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":51.45657,\"lon\":7.01228}},{\"facility\":\"Institut fur Klinische Transfusionmedizin und Immungenetick\",\"city\":\"Ulm\",\"country\":\"Germany\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":48.39841,\"lon\":9.99155}},{\"city\":\"Dublin\",\"country\":\"Ireland\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":53.33306,\"lon\":-6.24889}},{\"facility\":\"Azienda Ospediliera Universitatia Careggi\",\"city\":\"Florence\",\"country\":\"Italy\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":43.77925,\"lon\":11.24626}},{\"facility\":\"Universita degli Studi di Napoli\",\"city\":\"Naples\",\"country\":\"Italy\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":40.85216,\"lon\":14.26811}},{\"city\":\"Nijmegen\",\"country\":\"Netherlands\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":51.8425,\"lon\":5.85278}},{\"city\":\"Basel\",\"country\":\"Switzerland\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":47.55839,\"lon\":7.57327}},{\"city\":\"London\",\"country\":\"United Kingdom\",\"geoPoint\":{\"lat\":51.50853,\"lon\":-0.12574}}]},\"ipdSharingStatementModule\":{\"ipdSharing\":\"NO\"}},\"derivedSection\":{\"miscInfoModule\":{\"versionHolder\":\"2026-09-18\",\"removedCountries\":[\"Canada\",\"Spain\",\"Sweden\"]},\"conditionBrowseModule\":{\"meshes\":[{\"id\":\"D006457\",\"term\":\"Hemoglobinuria, Paroxysmal\"}],\"ancestors\":[{\"id\":\"D000743\",\"term\":\"Anemia, Hemolytic\"},{\"id\":\"D000740\",\"term\":\"Anemia\"},{\"id\":\"D006402\",\"term\":\"Hematologic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D006425\",\"term\":\"Hemic and Lymphatic Diseases\"},{\"id\":\"D009190\",\"term\":\"Myelodysplastic Syndromes\"},{\"id\":\"D001855\",\"term\":\"Bone Marrow Diseases\"}]}},\"hasResults\":false}", "media_type": "application/json", "text_derivation": {"extractor_version": "stdlib-json-object-slice-v1", "method": "ctgov-study-json-v1", "raw_asset": {"byte_size": 666988, "media_type": "application/json", "relative_path": "evidence/raw/sha256/7c/7ce4995256632f1ce93e0e7444e375fecb7379ed09eb6dc461c4c809907a31f1.bin", "sha256": "7ce4995256632f1ce93e0e7444e375fecb7379ed09eb6dc461c4c809907a31f1"}, "record_selector": {"nct_id": "NCT01412047", "study_index": 16}, "schema_version": "1.0", "text_sha256": "06c1d0151bbff7e4dad368c1c4ad79b4a21764223dc4ffc8c947e3f134c53de0"}}